---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';

const tiles = ['A', 'B', 'C', 'D'];
---

<section id="stealth" class="section relative overflow-hidden border-t border-line bg-bg-sunken" aria-labelledby="stealth-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="max-w-3xl" data-reveal>
      <p class="eyebrow flex items-center gap-2"><Icon name="eye-off" class="h-3.5 w-3.5" /> Stealth mode <span aria-hidden="true">·</span> New in v2.25</p>
      <h2 id="stealth-title" class="h2 mt-4">
        Visible to you. <span class="text-ink-3">Invisible to the screen share.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="lede">
        Turn on <span class="text-ink">Hide from screen share</span> and the overlay stays right where you put it on your
        screen, but is left out of screen sharing, recordings and screenshots.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Illustration: your screen vs. what is captured -->
    <div class="mt-14 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 90ms">
      <figure class="min-w-0">
        <div class="relative aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-line-strong bg-bg-raised p-3" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="grid h-full grid-cols-2 gap-2 pr-[38%]">
            {tiles.map((t) => (
              <div class="flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-bg-panel">
                <span class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#232838] text-xs font-medium text-ink-3 sm:h-10 sm:w-10">{t}</span>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
          <div class="absolute bottom-3 right-3 top-3 flex w-[35%] flex-col gap-1.5 rounded-xl border border-brand/40 bg-[#0e1220]/95 p-2 shadow-[0_0_0_4px_rgba(59,130,246,0.08)] sm:gap-2 sm:p-2.5">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-rec"></span>
              <span class="font-mono text-[0.5625rem] text-ink-3 sm:text-[0.625rem]">NexQ</span>
            </div>
            <div class="h-1.5 w-[85%] rounded-full bg-them/50"></div>
            <div class="h-1.5 w-[70%] rounded-full bg-ink-3/40"></div>
            <div class="mt-auto space-y-1.5 rounded-lg bg-brand/10 p-1.5 sm:p-2">
              <div class="h-1.5 w-full rounded-full bg-brand-ink/60"></div>
              <div class="h-1.5 w-[80%] rounded-full bg-brand-ink/40"></div>
              <div class="h-1.5 w-[60%] rounded-full bg-brand-ink/30"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <figcaption class="mt-3 flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-ink-2">
          <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-brand" aria-hidden="true"></span> On your screen: meeting plus the NexQ overlay
        </figcaption>
      </figure>

      <figure class="min-w-0">
        <div class="relative aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-line-strong bg-bg-raised p-3" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="grid h-full grid-cols-2 gap-2 pr-[38%]">
            {tiles.map((t) => (
              <div class="flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-bg-panel">
                <span class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#232838] text-xs font-medium text-ink-3 sm:h-10 sm:w-10">{t}</span>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
          <div class="absolute bottom-3 right-3 top-3 w-[35%]"></div>
          <span class="absolute left-3 top-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md bg-rec/90 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.625rem] font-medium text-[#1a0b0b]">
            SHARING
          </span>
        </div>
        <figcaption class="mt-3 flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-ink-2">
          <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-ink-3" aria-hidden="true"></span> In the share, recording or screenshot: no overlay
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-14 grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12">
      <div class="lg:col-span-7" data-reveal>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink">Switch it however suits you</h3>
        <ul class="mt-5 divide-y divide-line border-y border-line">
          <li class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 py-4">
            <span class="text-ink-2">Global shortcut, from any app <span class="text-ink-3">(rebindable)</span></span>
            <span class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 text-sm text-ink-3">
              <span class="flex items-center gap-1"><kbd class="kbd">Ctrl</kbd><kbd class="kbd">Shift</kbd><kbd class="kbd">H</kbd></span>
              <span>on Windows</span>
              <span class="flex items-center gap-1"><kbd class="kbd">⌘</kbd><kbd class="kbd">Shift</kbd><kbd class="kbd">H</kbd></span>
              <span>on macOS</span>
            </span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 py-4">
            <span class="text-ink-2">Settings → General</span>
            <span class="text-sm text-ink-3">Hide from screen share</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 py-4">
            <span class="text-ink-2">Overlay header</span>
            <span class="text-sm text-ink-3">One button, mid-meeting</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 py-4">
            <span class="text-ink-2">Tray menu</span>
            <span class="text-sm text-ink-3">Hide from Screen Share</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <aside class="lg:col-span-5" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 90ms" aria-label="Compatibility">
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-them/25 bg-them/[0.06] p-6">
          <p class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium text-them">
            <Icon name="shield" class="h-4 w-4" /> What to expect
          </p>
          <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-[0.9375rem] leading-relaxed text-ink-2">
            <li>
              <span class="text-ink">Windows 10 version 2004 or later:</span> excluded from Zoom, Teams, Google Meet and OBS
              captures (uses <code class="font-mono text-[0.8125rem] text-ink">WDA_EXCLUDEFROMCAPTURE</code>).
            </li>
            <li>
              <span class="text-ink">macOS:</span> uses <code class="font-mono text-[0.8125rem] text-ink">NSWindowSharingNone</code>.
              On macOS 14 and later, some recorders built on ScreenCaptureKit may still capture the window.
            </li>
            <li>Try it with your own setup before a call that matters.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
